WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.779
Before you buy a single bench, you should be able to walk through your new workspace.

00:00:07.059 --> 00:00:08.627
That is what a layout does.

00:00:09.227 --> 00:00:14.282
Without a layout, furniture can arrive that blocks aisles, clashes with machines,

00:00:14.282 --> 00:00:16.216
or leaves no room for trolleys.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:22.363
The process starts with four inputs: the task at each station and the equipment on it,

00:00:22.363 --> 00:00:28.297
the load and whether operators sit or stand, your room dimensions, and any reference photos.

00:00:28.577 --> 00:00:33.354
From these, we prepare a 2D plan and a 3D view, so you can see the fit,

00:00:33.354 --> 00:00:36.382
the flow and the clearances before you order.

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:41.862
Changes on a drawing cost nothing; changes after delivery cost time and money.

00:00:42.462 --> 00:00:48.630
We plan the whole area, not just the benches: workstations, storage, material flow and access.

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:55.186
With one clean-tech manufacturer, our analysis showed that 8 benches, not the 2 first requested,

00:00:55.186 --> 00:00:57.932
would spread the assembly stages properly.

00:00:58.532 --> 00:01:00.038
Plan first, then order.

00:01:00.318 --> 00:01:02.404
Share your room size and task with us.

00:01:02.684 --> 00:01:07.973
Comment below or request a consult, and next, learn why configured beats custom.

00:01:08.573 --> 00:01:12.818
Furnisys: complete workspace systems, planned around your process.

